<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><gpx version="1.1" creator="The Gunks Gravel Escape" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>From New Paltz · North Lookout loop · Sky Lakes · two loops from town</name><desc>Leave from Thursday’s finish at Water Street Market. Friday visits Mohonk’s northern carriage roads. Return to the same Main Street crossing at the end of the ride.</desc><link href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright"><text>OpenStreetMap linework</text></link><link href="https://www.mohonk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Bike-Map-2024.pdf"><text>Designated ridge bicycle routes</text></link><link href="https://www.openspaceinstitute.org/where/new-york/shawangunks/river-to-ridge-trail"><text>River-to-Ridge map</text></link><link href="https://www.mohonk.com/recreation-activities/mountain-biking/"><text>Mountain House carriage roads</text></link><link href="https://www.openspaceinstitute.org/news/lake-awosting-restoration"><text>Lake Awosting loop reopening</text></link><link href="https://parks.ny.gov/visit/state-parks/minnewaska-state-park-preserve"><text>Minnewaska map and cycling conditions</text></link><link href="https://www.mohonkpreserve.org/plan-your-visit/"><text>Cycling day pass and hours</text></link><link href="https://forecast.weather.gov/MapClick.php?lat=41.736&amp;lon=-74.197"><text>Current point forecast</text></link><link href="https://511ny.org/"><text>Road incidents and traffic</text></link><link href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright"><text>How the ride was measured</text></link><link href="https://data.usgs.gov/datacatalog/data/USGS%3A3a81321b-c153-416f-98b7-cc8e5f0e17c3"><text>Elevation estimates</text></link></metadata><wpt lat="41.74685" lon="-74.089171"><name>1. New Paltz · Water Street Market start</name><desc>Start on the north side of Main Street at the rail-trail crossing. Walk west on the sidewalk toward the Wallkill River.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.746712" lon="-74.089882"><name>2. Water Street crosswalk</name><desc>Walk across Water Street in the crosswalk. Follow the north sidewalk onto the separated bridge path.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.746844" lon="-74.090867"><name>3. Carmine Liberta Bridge · west bank</name><desc>At the west end of the bridge, turn north onto the River-to-Ridge path beside the Wallkill River.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.750376" lon="-74.095296"><name>4. Springtown Road · outbound crossing</name><desc>Cross the road at the trailhead and continue west into the fields.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.748664" lon="-74.109195"><name>5. River-to-Ridge field fork</name><desc>Follow the northern branch of the field loop toward Butterville Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.752119" lon="-74.123434"><name>6. Butterville Road · outbound crossing</name><desc>Yield at the marked crossing and continue toward Pine Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.751247" lon="-74.124877"><name>7. Pine Road · outbound crossing</name><desc>Cross Pine Road and follow the signed River-to-Ridge route to the Foothills. Follow any posted construction controls.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.745812" lon="-74.129735"><name>8. Foothills · east to the Gateway</name><desc>Turn east onto Lenape Lane toward the stone Testimonial Gateway. The route returns to this junction after the pass stop.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.744979" lon="-74.118505"><name>9. Testimonial Gateway · cycling pass</name><desc>The bike track turns at the arch. Walk the signed footpath to the trailhead booth for today&#39;s cycling pass and the Mountain House waiver. Return west on the Pin Oak Allée.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.745812" lon="-74.129735"><name>10. Foothills · uphill on Lenape</name><desc>Continue west on Lenape Lane and climb to the Lower Duck Pond Road junction.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.754881" lon="-74.138625"><name>11. Lower Duck Pond Road</name><desc>Leave Lenape Lane and take Lower Duck Pond Road toward the pond. Follow the bicycle carriage road along the water.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.753538" lon="-74.145161"><name>12. Duck Pond · Glory Hill Road</name><desc>From the northwest side of the pond, take Glory Hill Road toward Oakwood Drive.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.751899" lon="-74.150745"><name>13. Glory Hill / Oakwood · straight on</name><desc>Cross the Oakwood Drive junction and continue on Glory Hill to Old Stage Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.754374" lon="-74.151362"><name>14. Old Stage Road</name><desc>Take Old Stage Road north to Forest Drive.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.761551" lon="-74.154425"><name>15. Forest Drive · eastbound</name><desc>Follow Forest Drive east toward Oakwood Drive and the northern carriage roads.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.76379" lon="-74.142185"><name>16. Oakwood Drive · east to Lenape</name><desc>Take Oakwood Drive east for the short link to Lenape Lane.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.764665" lon="-74.140982"><name>17. Lenape Lane · north to the gatehouse</name><desc>Turn north on Lenape Lane. The return leg comes back through this junction.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.778366" lon="-74.135685"><name>18. Gatehouse · dismount</name><desc>Walk through the short resort-drive link, then take the signed Spring Farm carriage road to the Whitney Road junction.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.77908" lon="-74.135467"><name>19. Whitney Road</name><desc>Take Whitney Road southwest to North Lookout Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.773345" lon="-74.142859"><name>20. North Lookout Road · westbound</name><desc>Follow North Lookout west toward the Mossy Brook junction.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.771691" lon="-74.154615"><name>21. Mossy Brook · dismount</name><desc>Turn onto Mossy Brook Road and walk the resort-drive section, following the GPX across the short connecting link.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.773407" lon="-74.154105"><name>22. Mossy Brook carriage road</name><desc>Resume riding on the carriage road toward Cedar Drive.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.777335" lon="-74.148216"><name>23. Cedar Drive · eastbound</name><desc>Take Cedar Drive east to Old Glen Anna Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.777629" lon="-74.143707"><name>24. Old Glen Anna Road</name><desc>Turn onto Old Glen Anna Road and ride southeast to Bonticou Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.775628" lon="-74.142194"><name>25. Bonticou Road</name><desc>Follow Bonticou Road south to North Lookout Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.773345" lon="-74.142859"><name>26. North Lookout Road · to Hemlock Lane</name><desc>Rejoin North Lookout Road and follow it to the Hemlock Lane turn.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.776545" lon="-74.146851"><name>27. Hemlock Lane</name><desc>Leave North Lookout Road for Hemlock Lane and continue south.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.773043" lon="-74.145469"><name>28. Huguenot Drive</name><desc>Take Huguenot Drive toward Bridge Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.77006" lon="-74.14503"><name>29. Bridge Road / Kleine Kill Road</name><desc>Follow the bridge carriage road south to Forest Drive.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.766641" lon="-74.146435"><name>30. Forest Drive · westbound</name><desc>Follow Forest Drive toward Home Farm Circle.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.76106" lon="-74.15535"><name>31. Home Farm Drive</name><desc>Take Home Farm Drive and then Old Minnewaska Road toward Rhododendron Bridge.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.758259" lon="-74.165169"><name>32. Oakwood Drive · descend</name><desc>Turn southeast onto Oakwood Drive at the near end of Rhododendron Bridge. Stay on Oakwood through the Old Stage and Glory Hill junctions.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.764665" lon="-74.140982"><name>33. Lenape Lane · descend to the fields</name><desc>Turn south and downhill on Lenape Lane to the Foothills junction.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.745812" lon="-74.129735"><name>34. Foothills · River-to-Ridge return</name><desc>Leave Lenape Lane and take River-to-Ridge northeast across the fields toward New Paltz.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.751247" lon="-74.124877"><name>35. Pine Road · return crossing</name><desc>Cross Pine Road toward the farm fields and Butterville Road. Follow posted construction controls.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.752119" lon="-74.123434"><name>36. Butterville Road · return crossing</name><desc>Cross the paved road on the field trail toward the Wallkill River.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.751616" lon="-74.118573"><name>37. Southern field branch</name><desc>Take the southern branch of the field loop heading east. The branches meet again before Springtown Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.750376" lon="-74.095296"><name>38. Springtown Road · return crossing</name><desc>Cross toward the river and follow the riverside path south to the bridge.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.746844" lon="-74.090867"><name>39. Carmine Liberta Bridge · eastbound</name><desc>Use the separated bridge path into town. Walk the short sidewalk and use the Water Street crosswalk.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.74685" lon="-74.089171"><name>40. New Paltz · Water Street Market finish</name><desc>Finish on the north sidewalk at Main Street and the Wallkill Valley Rail Trail, at the same point where you started.</desc></wpt><trk><name>From New Paltz · North Lookout loop · Sky Lakes · two loops from town</name><trkseg><trkpt lat="41.74685" lon="-74.089171"/><trkpt lat="41.746828" lon="-74.08925"/><trkpt lat="41.74671" lon="-74.089777"/><trkpt lat="41.746701" lon="-74.089844"/><trkpt lat="41.746712" lon="-74.089882"/><trkpt lat="41.746716" lon="-74.089991"/><trkpt lat="41.746718" lon="-74.090071"/><trkpt lat="41.746721" lon="-74.090085"/><trkpt lat="41.746744" lon="-74.090217"/><trkpt lat="41.746844" lon="-74.090867"/><trkpt lat="41.74685" lon="-74.090895"/><trkpt lat="41.746864" lon="-74.090922"/><trkpt lat="41.746887" lon="-74.090954"/><trkpt lat="41.746904" lon="-74.090987"/><trkpt lat="41.746922" lon="-74.091036"/><trkpt lat="41.746961" lon="-74.091164"/><trkpt lat="41.746986" lon="-74.091234"/><trkpt lat="41.747025" lon="-74.091338"/><trkpt lat="41.747113" lon="-74.091546"/><trkpt lat="41.747177" lon="-74.091711"/><trkpt lat="41.747217" lon="-74.091796"/><trkpt lat="41.747276" lon="-74.091867"/><trkpt lat="41.747336" lon="-74